{"id":2617,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>4月25日，中北大学第四十四届学生春季田径运动会圆满落幕。经济与管理学院学子奋勇拼搏、团结进取，在本次运动会中斩获团体总分第七名，并荣获大会精神文明奖，以双重荣誉展现了经管学子的运动风采与文明风貌。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLzvYPMmT2olCPo4RGYUmUZL4NDMmN8YnmLbMmGbLz6knR-0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8MYyDLYyZozffM4nRnRLaL7nRMm9iozlbMNCYUzMfM8rFMmGZnlQ7U8WFU4NDMkb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmvbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23279&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A4763890A74CD300DC6859596F2A3A7E/608EFDCB/C964\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLzvYPMmT2olCPo4RGYUmUZL4NDMmN8YnmLbMmGbLz6knR-0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8MYyDLYyZozffM4nRnRLaL7nRMm9iozlbMNCYUzMfM8rFMmGZnlQ7U8WFU4NDMkb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmvbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23279&e=.jpeg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL8LYaL4Nbnl-Dn4R9ZUmlbU4AfLN-8PozvbL4-aLz6VozC0gihFp2hmCIa0oky4M1hRLky8MmG8LzLZo7QRUmG8Lz6RMmV2UznRol7ZU4nFLRl4L4lDLm6FnRGsokb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmvbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23279&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/836C046041388FCB0417C61FA4C9A8C4/05335627/D078\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PL8LYaL4Nbnl-Dn4R9ZUmlbU4AfLN-8PozvbL4-aLz6VozC0gihFp2hmCIa0oky4M1hRLky8MmG8LzLZo7QRUmG8Lz6RMmV2UznRol7ZU4nFLRl4L4lDLm6FnRGsokb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmvbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23279&e=.jpeg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>赛场上，经管健儿们斗志昂扬、全力以赴，在短跑、长跑、接力、投掷等多个项目中奋勇争先，用汗水诠释了 “更快、更高、更强” 的体育精神。无论是赛道上的风驰电掣，还是赛场边的呐喊助威，都彰显了经管学子强烈的集体荣誉感与凝聚力。赛场下，同学们自觉遵守赛事纪律，文明观赛、热情服务，以良好的精神风貌赢得了大会组委会与师生的一致认可，成功获评精神文明奖。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLzvYPMmT2olCPo4RGYUmUZL4NDMmN8YnmLbMmGbLz6knR-0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8MYyDLYyZozffM4nRnRLaL7nRMm9iozlbMNCYUzMfM8rFMmGZnlQ7U8WFU4NDMkb/v2rjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-4LmvbgtA8pUicc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=23279&e=.jpeg"}